  "meta": {
    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "A custom block with behaviour. Using it (msm:on_interact) or powering it with redstone (on_powered of msm:redstone) fires the event msm_examples:lamp_turn_on. The event's actions run in order: a click, then set_block_state replaces the lamp with the lit lamp. An action cannot change a block's own properties, so a second block stands for the lit state. Export the Fabric mod jar to try it in game.",
